    <content:encoded>This is a story of flight, of Adam and Colin learning to fly and the first decade of their flying.

Because the entries are infested with aviation jargon, we have &lt;a title="Glossary" href="http://flyingsummers.com/glossary/"&gt;a glossary&lt;/a&gt;.

We read a lot of aviation blogs and use tools that are on the web, so we &lt;a title="Links" href="http://flyingsummers.com/links/"&gt;collected the links&lt;/a&gt;.

We also read real, published books, entirely separate from the web. &lt;a title="Books" href="http://flyingsummers.com/books/"&gt;We review them&lt;/a&gt; when we think of it.</content:encoded>
